        "TileImage": "$($repository 294f2b42-21ff-4a98-925c-2752faeb24b1).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Hungry Mac&apos;s Unbarian,\r\rThe ICA have discovered an unknown hitsquad hiding in Florida, with plans to assassinate  an attendee at the Global Innovation Race.\r\rDisguised as a fast-food employee you must eliminate the assassin&apos;s, without raising suspicion &amp; before they find their target.\r\rThe ICA provides a variety of poisons for you to create a perfect Wahoo Burger (TM) for them to try.\r\rEnjoy the meal.\rThis ones... really got a kick to it.",
